          ],
          "correctOptionId": "4",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Given arrangement:</strong> 4 7 @ J # 9 P $ L % O &copy; 5 &amp; G C W D 3 8 @ S # 1 F Y V</p>\n\n<p>If all the numbers are dropped in the given arrangement: @ J # P $ L % O &copy; &amp; G C W D @ S # F Y V</p>\n\n<p><strong>Consonants</strong> which are immediately preceded by a symbol are: <strong>@ J, # P, $ L</strong><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">,&nbsp;</span><strong>&amp; G, @ S, # F</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>there are six consonants that are immediately preceded by a symbol</strong>.</p>",
