        {
          "id": "60524d256ff9cd545c070665",
          "questionNumber": 6,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "If in the word &lsquo;DEFECTED&rsquo;, all the letters are arranged in the reverse alphabetical order (i.e. Z - A) and then the first four letters are changed to the previous letter&nbsp;and the last four letters are changed to the next letter. After the final arrangement, which of the following letter is the second to the left of the letter which is fourth from the right end?",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "C",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "D",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "E",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "F",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "T",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "2",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>Given word: DEFECTED</p>\n\n<p>Reverse alphabetical order (Z-A): TFEEEDDC</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/Alphabets.PNG\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 112px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/14%20March-11.PNG\" style=\"width: 290px; height: 115px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Fourth letter from the right end = F</p>\n\n<p>Letter which is second to the left of F = D</p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>D</strong> is the correct answer.</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "60430ca0551d1cac21c76994",
          "questionNumber": 7,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "If the even digits of the number &lsquo;74258613&rsquo; are decreased by 2 and the odd digits are increased by 1, then which of the following number we will get on dividing the fourth digit from the right by the second digit from the left?",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "3",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "1",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "4",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "2",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)</span></span>",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "1",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>Given number: 74258613</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:330px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 150px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Digits of a number</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">7</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">4</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">2</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">5</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">8</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">6</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">1</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">3</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 220px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Applying the given rule</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">+1</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">-2</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">-2</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">+1</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">-2</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">-2</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">+1</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">+1</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>New Digits</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">8</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">2</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">0</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">6</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">6</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">4</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">2</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">4</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Fourth digit from the right&nbsp;= 6</p>\n\n<p>Second digit from the left&nbsp;= 2</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, required answer = 6&nbsp;&divide; 2&nbsp;= 3</p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>3</strong>&nbsp;is the correct answer.</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "60326b240f382496580d903f",
          "questionNumber": 8,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Directions: Study the following information carefully to answer the given questions.</p>\n\n<p>M L O $ Q 2 Z ? < X F U&nbsp;! @ V 7&nbsp;3 5 A Y 6 8 * B > H 9 % S V U + 1</p>\n\n<p>Four of the following five are alike in a certain way based on their positions in the above arrangement and so form a group. Which is the one that does not belong to that group?</p>",
