          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "LQ$",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "ZX<",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "B9H",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "*%9",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "V1+",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "4",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Given series:</strong>&nbsp;M L O $ Q 2 Z ? < X F U&nbsp;! @ V 7&nbsp;3 5 A Y 6 8 * B > H 9 % S V U + 1</p>\n\n<p><strong>Left side </strong>M L O $ Q 2 Z ? < X F U&nbsp;! @ V 7&nbsp;3 5 A Y 6 8 * B > H 9 % S V U + 1 <strong>Right side</strong></p>\n\n<p>The pattern is as follows:</p>\n\n<p>Here, the group is formed in which the second element is the third to the right of the first element, and the third element is the immediate left&nbsp;of the third element&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>the correct answer is</strong> <strong>*%9.</strong></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
