          "correctOptionId": "3",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>If the vowels are changed to the next letter and the consonants are changed to the previous letters:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:400px;\" width=\"449\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:108px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Given Word</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:38px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">S</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:47px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">U</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:40px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">B</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:38px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">T</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">I</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">T</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">L</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:49px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">E</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:108px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>After change</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:38px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">R</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:47px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">V</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:40px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">A</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:38px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">S</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">J</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">S</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">K</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:49px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">F</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:108px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Alphabetical order</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:38px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">A</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:47px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">F</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:40px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">J</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:38px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">K</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">R</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">S</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:43px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">S</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:49px;height:28px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">V</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br />\nHence, <strong>&lsquo;S&rsquo; </strong>is 4<sup>th</sup> to the right of 3<sup>rd</sup> letter from the left end.&nbsp;</p>",
