          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p><b>Directions:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 50, 56);  \">Read the information carefully and answer the questions given below.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 50, 56);  \">Q W E R T Y U I O P A S D F G H J K L Z X C V B N M</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 50, 56);  \">If the letters of the above series are written in reverse order then, which letter will be the fourth to the left of the eleventh letter from the right end?</span></p>",
