          ],
          "correctOptionId": "5",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>Given series:&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">LEFT SIDE</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(38, 50, 56);\">Q W E R T Y U I O P A S D F G H J K L Z X C V B N M&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">RIGHT SIDE</span></span></p>\n\n<p>Series in reverse order:</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">LEFT SIDE</span>&nbsp; M N B V C X Z L K J H G F D S A P O I U Y T R E W Q&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">RIGHT SIDE</span></p>\n\n<p>Eleventh letter from the right end:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">LEFT SIDE</span>&nbsp; M N B V C X Z L K J H G F D S&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">A&nbsp;</span>P O I U Y T R E W Q&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">RIGHT SIDE</span></p>\n\n<p>Fourth to the left of A:</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">LEFT SIDE</span>&nbsp; M N B V C X Z L K J H&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">G&nbsp;</span>F D S&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">A&nbsp;</span>P O I U Y T R E W Q&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">RIGHT SIDE</span></p>\n\n<p>G is fourth to the left of the eleventh element from the right end after reversing the series.</p>\n\n<p>Hence,<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;None of these is the correct answer.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Tip:</span></p>\n\n<p>We know,</p>\n\n<p>After reversing the series the left end will be right and vise versa.</p>\n\n<p>Left &amp; Left = First Left + Second Left</p>\n\n<p>11 + 4 = 15</p>\n\n<p>therefore, the sides have swapped, Right end = Left end.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the target letter is 15th from the left end of the series.</p>",
